# Airgapped k0rdent Enterprise {{.KcmVersion}} — Install Runbook

Generated by **airgapdeploy**. This runbook and the accompanying scripts encode
the Mirantis airgap install procedure for your specific configuration:

| Setting              | Value |
|----------------------|-------|
| k0rdent Enterprise   | `{{.KcmVersion}}` |
| k0s                  | `{{.K0sVersion}}` |
| Architectures        | `{{range $i, $a := .Architectures}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$a}}{{end}}` |
| Private registry     | `{{.Registry}}` |
